{"id":"P061-2","subject":"P","unit":"P061","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P061-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n동작시간에 따른 보호계전기의 분류에서 다음 각 설명에\n\n해당하는 보호계전기는?\n\n  ㉠  : 설정된 최소 동작전류 이상의 전류가 흐르면\n\n    즉시 동작하는 계전기\n\n  ㉡  : 설정된 값 이상의 전류가 흘렀을 때 전류값이\n\n    클수록 빠르게 동작하고 전류값이 작을수록\n\n    느리게 동작하는 계전기\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①   순한시 계전기      정한시 계전기\n\n ②   순한시 계전기      반한시 계전기\n\n ③   정한시 계전기      순한시 계전기\n\n ④   정한시 계전기      반한시 계전기\n\n ⑤   반한시 계전기      정한시 계전기","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":847},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":603},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m26-e2.webp","width":678,"height":927}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n%리액턴스의 관계성에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 용량에 비례하고, 선간전압에 반비례한다.\n\n② 용량에 비례하고, 선간전압의 제곱에 반비례한다.\n\n③ 용량에 비례하고, 선간전압의 제곱에 비례한다.\n\n④ 용량에 반비례하고, 선간전압에 비례한다.\n\n⑤ 용량에 반비례하고, 선간전압의 제곱에 비례한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":499}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n정격용량이 20000kVA, %임피던스가 5인 동기\n발전기의 단락용량은 몇 kVA인가?\n\n\n① 100000       ② 200000\n\n③ 300000       ④ 400000\n\n⑤ 500000","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m28-q.webp","width":678,"height":473},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":459}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n다음의 회로에서 단자 와 에서 바라본 등가 합성저항\n는 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 2           ② 3\n\n③ 4           ④ 5\n\n⑤ 6","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":763},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1524}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\nΩ, Ω을 병렬로 연결하는 경우, 합성\n\n임피던스는 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n                           \n①            ②  \n③        ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":534},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m30-e1.webp","width":696,"height":358}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 Ω, Ω,\n\nΩ이고, 에 흐르는 전류가 0A 일 때, 는\n\n몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n\n              ①    ② \n\n\n              ③   ④ \n\n\n              ⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m31-q.webp","width":696,"height":586},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":840}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n∠°Ω의 부하에 흐르는 전류가\n\n                     일 때, 부하에 나타나는sinA\n전압의 순싯값는 몇 V인가?\n\n①                sin\n②               sin\n\n③   sin\n\n④  sin\n\n⑤  sin","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m32-q.webp","width":678,"height":830},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m32-e1.webp","width":678,"height":628}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n역률에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 역률은 최대 1이다.\n\n② 유효전력을 무효전력으로 나누어 계산한다.\n\n③ 역률이 1인 경우 전압과 전류의 위상은 동위상이다.\n\n④ 부하 역률이 1인 경우, 부하에서 필요로 하는 전체\n\n  전류는 최소가 된다.\n\n⑤ 부하 역률이 1인 경우, 전력손실이 최소가 된다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m33-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m33-e1.webp","width":678,"height":415},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m33-e2.webp","width":696,"height":242}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n\n직렬 공진회로의 특징으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 전류와 전압의 위상은 동일하다.\n\n② 임피던스는 0Ω이다.\n\n③ 임피던스는 순 실수로 나타난다.\n\n④ 회로에 흐르는 전류는 최대가 된다.\n\n⑤ 회로의 역률은 1이 된다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m34-q.webp","width":678,"height":450},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m34-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1078}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n다음의 회로에서, 각 저항에 흐르는 전류  ,  , 는\n\n각각 몇 A 인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n           A            A           A \n\n ①       4             1.6            2.4\n\n ②       4             2.4            1.6\n\n ③       5             1.6            2.4\n\n ④       5             2.4            1.6\n\n ⑤       5            3            2","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m35-q.webp","width":696,"height":1071},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m35-e1.webp","width":696,"height":565}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n3상 회로의 특징으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 평형상태에서 각 상의 전압을 합하면 0이 된다.\n\n② 평형부하의 경우 크기는 같고, 각 상의 위상차는 120°\n\n  이다.\n\n③ Y결선의 선전류와 상전류는 같다.\n\n④ Y결선의 선간전압은 상전압보다 위상이 30° 앞선다.\n⑤ △결선의 선간전압은 상전압의 배이다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m36-q.webp","width":696,"height":811},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m36-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n다음과 같은 T형 회로망에서 임피던스 파라미터 , ,\n\n, 는?\n\n\n\n\n\n                                     \n\n ①     1        2        2        3\n\n ②     2        3        5        2\n\n ③     3        2        2        2\n\n ④     4        2        2        5\n\n ⑤     3        2        2        5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m37-q.webp","width":678,"height":970},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m37-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1144}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 s에서 스위치 를 닫을 때,\n회로에 흐르는 전류 A 는 어떻게 표현되는가?\n\n\n\n\n\n①           ② \n③         ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m38-q.webp","width":678,"height":912},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m38-e1.webp","width":696,"height":738},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m38-e2.webp","width":678,"height":656}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n대칭성 비정형파의 푸리에 급수에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은\n\n것은?\n\n\n① 비정현파의 가장 낮은 주파수 성분은 기본파이다.\n\n② 비정현파의 정수배의 주파수와 같은 성분은 고조파이다.\n\n③ 주파수가 0인 것은 1주기의 평균값과 같다.\n\n④ 일 때, cos항은 없다.\n\n⑤ 반파 대칭이면 홀수 차수의 고조파는 없다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m39-q.webp","width":696,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m39-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1228}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P061-S2-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션) · 객관식 40번","searchText":" 40\n\n\n전류의 순싯값이                                로 표현될              sinA\n\n때, 이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n     ㉠ 전류의 평균값은                           이다.       A\n\n     ㉡ 전류의 위상은 30° 뒤진다.\n\n     ㉢ 주파수는 Hz이다.\n\n     ㉣ 전류의 실횻값은 100A 이다.\n\n\n\n① ㉠㉡         ② ㉡㉢\n\n③ ㉡㉣         ④ ㉠㉡㉢\n\n⑤ ㉡㉢㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.19 한국에너지공단 (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2024h2-e20-m40","number":40},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m40-q.webp","width":696,"height":1199},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e20-m40-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
